on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  4] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [  6] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = the volume of sound 2
  [  8] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 12] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [ 14] pushzero ................................ <0>
